<title>USA: L.L. Knickerbocker buys Thailand's Harlyn.</title>
<headline>L.L. Knickerbocker buys Thailand's Harlyn.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO SANTA MARGARITA, Calif 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The L.L. Knickerbocker Co Inc said it had completed its acquisition of Harlyn International Co Inc in Thailand.</p>
<p>The company said it bought Harlyn's stock for $2.3 million in cash.</p>
<p>Harlyn's sales were about $10 million with assets of about $5.2 million, it said, adding that it was a manufacturer and marketer of fine jewellery.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
